WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.867
He survived

2
00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.133
an atomic bomb.

3
00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:03.400
Three days later,

4
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.667
he survived another.

5
00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:07.100
This is Tsutomu Yamaguchi,

6
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.200
a Mitsubishi

7
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.333
shipbuilding engineer.

8
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.333
August sixth,

9
00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:11.200
nineteen forty-five.

10
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.867
He was in Hiroshima

11
00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:13.733
on business

12
00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:15.400
when the United States

13
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.100
dropped an atomic bomb.

14
00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.500
Severely burned,

15
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.733
he survived.

16
00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:21.167
The next day,

17
00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:22.533
he boarded a train.

18
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:23.933
It carried him home

19
00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:24.600
to Nagasaki.

20
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.700
On August ninth,

21
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.667
he was back at work.

22
00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:31.833
He recalled describing

23
00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:33.433
Hiroshima to his manager.

24
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.467
Then came another flash.

25
00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.133
The second atomic bomb

26
00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:37.967
had struck.

27
00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:39.633
He survived again.

28
00:00:39.633 --> 00:00:41.767
His wife and infant son

29
00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:42.633
survived too.

30
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.100
The bombings killed

31
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.400
tens of thousands

32
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.167
and left lasting suffering.

33
00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:49.400
In two thousand nine,

34
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.800
Japan officially recognized

35
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.733
his exposure

36
00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:53.133
in both cities.

37
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.867
He was not the only
double survivor.

38
00:00:56.267 --> 00:00:58.633
He lived until twenty ten,

39
00:00:58.633 --> 00:00:59.600
aged ninety-three.

40
00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:00.933
In later years,

41
00:01:00.933 --> 00:01:02.467
he urged the world

42
00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:04.000
to abolish nuclear weapons.
